{"3423660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Backrooms: Exploration", "steam_appid": 3423660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3590280], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Exploration</strong> is a single-player horror game, that takes place in 2020. Two friends have lost their jobs due to COVID-19, but they still have to bring food to the table. After a failed heist, one of them ends up in the Backrooms. Now your only mission is to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423660/extras/c46c14016b3b6891a7fc1eb4ad278769.avif?t=1779789850\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423660/extras_big/c46c14016b3b6891a7fc1eb4ad278769.avif?t=1779789850 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Backrooms: Exploration</strong>, you have to find your way out of the Backrooms. Everything is viewed through a Bodycam which is mounted on your head. <strong>Backrooms: Exploration</strong> is  an atmospheric experience, that entertains everyone who enjoys the Backrooms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the many levels of Backrooms in the most realistic way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience this unique story about the Backrooms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some parts of this game are heavily inspired by <strong>Kane Pixels</strong>' work.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Exploration</strong> is a single-player horror game, that takes place in 2020. Two friends have lost their jobs due to COVID-19, but they still have to bring food to the table. After a failed heist, one of them ends up in the Backrooms. Now you